    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the document_client.py file, I need to write the file with the necessary imports and utility functions for configuring and using an OCR and Layout Extraction service. I will use the Amazon Textract service for this purpose, as it provides both OCR and layout extraction capabilities. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861063162,
          "start": 1789861061008
        },
