    {
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create extract_key_values.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts key-value pairs from a form-like document.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc083a3f001xxM38QaL6gLqbl",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc083a3c001eJYrX0Iw1t0Rmz",
      "session_id": "ses_f43f7c5ccffesuSeP0Na4BDDJ5",
      "time_created": 1789861050944,
      "time_updated": 1789861050944
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "type": "step-start"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc084048001gR55TjzysbFPLN",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc083a42001h5LEfCUirjRQRx",
      "session_id": "ses_f43f7c5ccffesuSeP0Na4BDDJ5",
      "time_created": 1789861052488,
      "time_updated": 1789861052489
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract key-value pairs from a form-like document, I can use the Amazon Textract service, which is a machine learning service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. I will write Python code that uses the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. The code will be identifiable as using Amazon Textract by importing the Boto3 library and calling the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861055660,
          "start": 1789861052490
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc08404a001HVJWTBMW5UEZrb",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc083a42001h5LEfCUirjRQRx",
      "session_id": "ses_f43f7c5ccffesuSeP0Na4BDDJ5",
      "time_created": 1789861052490,
      "time_updated": 1789861055661
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_tkhZBvRsZctN60LTMPHK9q",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef extract_key_values(document):\n    textract_client = boto3.client('textract')\n    response = textract_client.analyze_document(\n        Document={'Bytes': document},\n        FeatureTypes=['FORMS'])\n    key_values = {}\n    for block in response['Blocks']:\n        if block['BlockType'] == 'KEY_VALUE_SET':\n            for relationship in block['Relationships']:\n                if relationship['Type'] == 'CHILD':\n                    key = None\n                    value = None\n                    for child_id in relationship['Ids']:\n                        child_block = next(b for b in response['Blocks'] if b['Id'] == child_id)\n                        if child_block['BlockType'] == 'WORD':\n                            if key is None:\n                                key = child_block['Text']\n                            else:\n                                value = child_block['Text']\n                    if key and value:\n                        key_values[key] = value\n    return key_values",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-rqrev8ay/extract_key_values.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
